    "body": "My question the new documentation does not explain how the form submission work \r\nStep one: Identify the [successful controls](https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/interact/forms.html#successful-controls) \r\nStep two: Build a form data set\r\nStep three: Encode the form data set \r\nStep four: Submit the encoded form data set",
